  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed roof extensions, including the hip-to-gable alteration, increased ridge height, change to the main roof angle, extension over the existing flat roof, and rear dormer, would cumulatively create a visually intrusive and overly dominant form of development. This would unacceptably disrupt the symmetry of the semi-detached pair and detract from the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the surrounding area. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD6, DMD8, DMD11, DMD13, and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
